--- This file is the place of the language-independent model of the shared memory of a client
--- and a TA (TEEC_TempMemoryReference of [Client API] 3.2.5): the memory of the client is copied
--- to the TA when an operation starts, the TA runs on it, and it is copied back when the
--- operation completes.  The calls of a program with shared objects and their typing are given by the
--- language (SHARED-MEMORY-SYNTAX and SHARED-MEMORY-BEHAVIOR in lang/c/tee-support.maude).
